  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gynuity Med abortion</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gynuity med aborter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3 Gynuity genomf&#xF6;r forskning p&#xE5; l&#xE4;kemedlet Misoprostol f&#xF6;r att f&#xE5; fram b&#xE4;st behandling och yttest f&#xF6;r att f&#xE5; l&#xE4;kemedlet som s&#xE4;ljs p&#xE5; indikation mags&#xE5;r ocks&#xE5; kan f&#xF6;rs&#xE4;ljas p&#xE5; indikation medicinsk abort.L&#xE4;kemedelet &#xE4;r avpatenterat och billigt. Anv&#xE4;nds &#xE4;ven i v&#xE4;stv&#xE4;rlden men d&#xE5; oftast i kombination med ytterligare ett medel som &#xE4;r betydligt dyrare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gynuity are making research on the drug Misoprostol for medical abortion. The drug is off-patent and consequently inexpensive and available for low resource settings.The drug is used in the Western World since many years but mostly together with complementing drugs that are costly. The long term objective is also to have the drug Misoprostol registred on indication medical abortion</narrative>
  </description>
